  "definition": "sosa:System",
  "label": "ISS Position Publisher",
  "description": "Software publisher that computes ISS geodetic position from NORAD orbital elements using SGP4 propagation and emits real-time position observations (lat, lon, alt, velocity) every 30 seconds. Fetches Two-Line Element sets from CelesTrak, propagates with the SGP4 model, and publishes via CSAPI/OSH.",
